300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.webm?t=1763063545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/8698c72e8fe356a14a59895c18661e73.mp4?t=1763063545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OH JACKIE, WHAT HAVE YOU DONE...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SERPENT AT THE VERNISSAGE</strong> is an <strong>open-world adventure</strong> set in an abandoned island paradise, where nothing is quite what it seems. <strong>Explore</strong> forgotten villas, sentient art pieces and sunken opera houses. And <strong>find your way back home</strong> before the archipelago swallows you whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.poster.avif?t=1763063545\" width=720 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.webm?t=1763063545\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/extras/aed8769afc4bf5a7839715c26f8ef9db.mp4?t=1763063545\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLEASE NOTE: CONTROLLERS ARE SUPPORTED, BUT KEYBOARD &amp; MOUSE IS RECCOMENDED. ALSO: PLEASE EXCUSE THE OCCASIONAL SHADER STUTTER. THANK YOU!</h2>","developers":["Daniel Bock"],"dlc":[4008120],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855760/b33011076f977641492b96335afb39f1b115d134/header.jpg?t=1763063545","is_free":false,"linux_require